Copyright 2026 TheGreenery

This product is a modified version of FreeToken (https://github.com/FlashML-org/FreeToken), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). It was taken from upstream commit 0d652e7 (2026-09-26) and merged with upstream up
to commit ee9789f (2026-10-10), then up to 9b68e00 (2026-10-15); every file changed or added relative to upstream is
listed, with the reason, in docs/rdna3/changes-from-upstream.md.

It includes ROCm support contributed to FreeToken by zihaomu (upstream pull requests #133, #134, #135) and pieces of a
community ROCm port of FreeToken by lukascechovic; see docs/rdna3/credits.md.

Its EXL3 support reads the format of exllamav3 by turboderp (https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3, MIT License):
the reference codec and the RDNA3 kernels were written from that project's description and CUDA sources; no exllamav3
code runs in this product.

Model weights (e.g. Qwen3.8-Flash-Next and its NVFP4 conversions) are not part of this product and are covered by
their own licenses.
